{"id":"eso-addon-manager","name":"ESO AddOn Manager","tagline":"Manage addons for The Elder Scrolls Online","blurb":"Update and install addons for ESO.","description":"Update and install addons for ESO. Primarily built on Linux for Linux. Sweetroll not included.\n\n• Install, remove, and search addons from esoui.com\n\n• Cross-platform support for Linux, macOS, and Windows\n\n• Specific support for ESO on the Steam Deck through Flathub\n\n• Automatically detect already installed addons\n\n• Options to auto update Tamriel Trade Centre prices and HarvestMap data\n\n• Light and dark UI themes\n\n• Import managed addons from Minion\n\n• Identify and install missing dependencies","developer":"arviceblot","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/arviceblot/eso-addon-manager/5a6f40e38fdd98c49419ee93de7b9097/icons/128x128/com.arviceblot.eso-addon-manager.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/arviceblot/eso-addon-manager/5a6f40e38fdd98c49419ee93de7b9097/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/arviceblot/eso-addon-manager/5a6f40e38fdd98c49419ee93de7b9097/screenshots/image-1_752x527@1.png","w":1082,"h":759},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/arviceblot/eso-addon-manager/5a6f40e38fdd98c49419ee93de7b9097/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/arviceblot/eso-addon-manager/5a6f40e38fdd98c49419ee93de7b9097/screenshots/image-2_752x527@1.png","w":1082,"h":759},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/arviceblot/eso-addon-manager/5a6f40e38fdd98c49419ee93de7b9097/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/arviceblot/eso-addon-manager/5a6f40e38fdd98c49419ee93de7b9097/screenshots/image-3_752x527@1.png","w":1082,"h":759},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/arviceblot/eso-addon-manager/5a6f40e38fdd98c49419ee93de7b9097/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/arviceblot/eso-addon-manager/5a6f40e38fdd98c49419ee93de7b9097/screenshot